## Not covered by this report

- **VRF-Lite / external connectivity.** The guide extends MAIN, PROD and IOT
  out of DC-Service-Leaf to the edge router over VRF-Lite. The Nexus as Code
  data model has no key for that attachment, so the pipeline does not do it
  and nothing here checks it. See the collection README's TODO.
- **The External fabric and its edge router.** Both are a manual prerequisite
  in this lab, created before the pipeline runs, so neither is this report's
  to verify.
- **Data plane.** This is an intent-versus-controller comparison. It proves
  Nexus Dashboard deployed what was declared; it does not prove a server on
  MainNetwork1 can reach one on ProdNetwork1.
